cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use CUDD, please cite the software itself, below. This
  repository (davidkebo/cudd) holds Fabio Somenzi's unmodified CUDD
  releases, maintained by David Kebo Houngninou; it is not an
  official upstream and does not patch CUDD's source.
title: "CUDD: CU Decision Diagram Package"
version: 3.0.0
date-released: "2015-12-31"
abstract: >-
  CUDD is a C library for the manipulation of binary decision
  diagrams (BDDs), algebraic decision diagrams (ADDs) and
  zero-suppressed binary decision diagrams (ZDDs). It includes the
  dddmp decision-diagram serialization library, a C++ wrapper, and
  the nanotrav demonstration program.
authors:
  - family-names: Somenzi
    given-names: Fabio
    affiliation: University of Colorado at Boulder
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/davidkebo/cudd"
url: "https://github.com/davidkebo/cudd"
keywords:
  - binary decision diagrams
  - BDD
  - ADD
  - ZDD
  - decision diagrams
  - formal verification
  - model checking
  - logic synthesis
